@startuml
title Stage 0.5 - ChannelRuntimeMeta write/read + TTL presence

actor "Decode Thread" as Decode
participant DummyDetectionNode as Detection
participant ChannelRuntimeMetaStoreInterface as MetaStore
participant OutputNode as Output
participant SimpleLogger as Logger

== DummyDetectionNode writes ==
Detection -> MetaStore : Write(channel_id, mutate)
activate MetaStore
MetaStore --> MetaStore : lock(channel_id)
MetaStore --> MetaStore : update last_seen_vehicle_monotonic_ns
MetaStore --> MetaStore : maybe adjust decode_fps_limit / detection_skip_frames
MetaStore --> Detection : return
deactivate MetaStore
Detection -> Logger : sample("vehicle seen", frame_id)

== OutputNode reads ==
Output -> MetaStore : Read(channel_id, inspect)
activate MetaStore
MetaStore --> MetaStore : lock(channel_id)
MetaStore --> Output : ChannelRuntimeMeta&
Output -> Output : IsVehiclePresent(now)
Output -> Logger : summary("vehicle_present", boolean)
deactivate MetaStore

note right of Output
OutputNode uses TTL helper
without copying the struct
end note

@enduml
